    <string name="settings_guard">Runaway guard</string>
    <string name="settings_guard_body1">This guards against a bug causing an infinite loop. It is not here to stop you.</string>
    <string name="settings_guard_body2">Choosing “burn until solved” is a legitimate choice, so there is no spending cap by default. But if the loop logic ever went wrong, it could keep burning while you sleep. A time limit covers exactly that case.</string>
    <string name="settings_guard_label">Continuous burn limit (minutes)</string>
    <string name="settings_guard_off">0 = no limit, burn forever</string>
    <string name="settings_guard_on">Stops automatically once exceeded</string>

